REDESIGN: five faster, louder directions for Night Gallop (one bet per round). Every screen loops live on the REAL certified curve: x1.17 at 1 s, x1.96 at 3 s, x7 at 6 s. The number cannot speed up without recertification, so the energy comes from the camera, cuts and effects around it.
Shared across all five:
- a burst the moment the round starts;
- zoom punches when the value passes x2, x5 and x10;
- speed, particles and shake that only ever rise with the value;
- lights out only after the crash;
- a shorter 2.6 s gap in these mockups (Nigeria and Ghana have no stated minimum; needs counsel).
Sharp display fonts, no dot-matrix. The horse is still a placeholder.
